# Admin token
@token = PASTE_YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

### All entries, newest first
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/audit-logs?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter by action / entity / user
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/audit-logs?action=ORDER_STATUS_CHANGED&entity=Order&userId=<user-uuid>
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
